repository-code: "https://github.com/keisuke0502watanabe/DSC-analyzer"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-05"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, browser-based tool for visualizing and analyzing
  differential scanning calorimetry data. Provides thermal-event
  extraction (Tm, dHm, dSm), isothermal Avrami kinetics with reusable
  fit presets, and a local IndexedDB store for files, projects and
  fitted features, with JSON export/import for portability.
keywords:
  - differential scanning calorimetry
  - thermal analysis
  - crystallization kinetics
  - Avrami analysis
  - polymorphism
